    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "f15088a8-7973-4c1d-8404-4da622451dad",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Explosive Paris Hijinx!",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102982470718",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5a3a3205-75d6-4cd9-b397-fee70e878601).Image",
        "Description": "Time for more KaBoom! This time in Paris because why not?\r\rAnd at what better place than at a fashion show to showcase our own explosive fashion of taking out those who didn&apos;t know they had it coming!\r\rAll except one, which as a compromise, has to be done as an accident for some reason (something about life insurance or what have you, like we care about that sort of thing). So make it look explosive as well!\r\rAs for the rest, a message needs to be sent!",
